Decisions the request didn't spell out:
- A line starting with `[` that doesn't end with `]` is an invalid line (throws) rather than a key.
- An empty key (`= v`) throws; a value of `""` becomes the empty string; a value with only a leading quote is left as-is (not treated as quoted).
- Duplicate `[section]` headers merge into the existing section object rather than resetting it.
- Error message format is `Invalid INI line <n>: <raw>` including the raw line text.

